  m_Name: VNDialog_ResetPassword
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  playerName: Kamu
  npcName: Edward
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91753b50188160e469f1596dd7b4e6be, type: 3}
  playerTalkingPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6f7b85b4da78fd74eb50431daa554c0f, type: 3}
  playerThinkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  playerSmilingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2Name: 
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0dac216d4f43e604fa4e16dfb97b2c6d, type: 3}
  npcTalkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npcThinkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npcSmilingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2TalkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2ThinkingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  npc2SmilingPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3ada09850f4b8084288e3397c62ac4ed, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Eh, kamu udah lihat notifikasi soal update password di desktop belum?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3b5e4b3a8a914bb7be5b12c2ce5c3af7, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 1
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Yang dari IT itu ya? Baru lihat sekilas, kenapa emang?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 35eabac4ff95499e92a7b1ea0d40cbb7, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Sekarang wajib ubah password lewat desktop, terus sekalian aktivasi MFA
      pakai kode OTP.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e2d5b53bdf224f90905d70c889d4eebf, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 1
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Oh jadi ada security yang ditambahkan?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec575eada7b44e5398dac5cb674e86d5, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Iya, sekarang ada OTP yang dikirim tiap login. Tadi aku coba, setelah ganti
      password langsung diminta verifikasi kode.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 20be151094c54a1188fed9ad678cecdf, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 1
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Kodenya dikirim ke mana?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5dfcf67784bd4abda17441929ae67237, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Ke email yang terdaftar. Jadi nanti tiap login dari desktop, masukin password
      dulu, habis itu verifikasi OTP.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 862f1314935241ebb1929235c1b2847e, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 1
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Oke sih, kelihatannya simpel. Proses ubah password-nya susah nggak?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e04ca9f921464f0b9b2ae7b624164eeb, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Nggak juga, tinggal masuk ke menu security di desktop, terus ikutin step-nya
      aja.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b3285fd0f9d416d96400a49f8078cb2, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 1
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Baiklah, nanti aku kerjain deh. Makasih informasi nya, Mas.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 489f7090f89d4beab87e3a5ee3b16aa6, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Siap, sama-sama.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 275aab5aacae4771a6d4045e34236af3, type: 3}
  hasChoice: 0
  acceptText: Ya
  rejectText: Tidak
  dialogueIfAccepted: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueIfRejected: {fileID: 0}
  actionID: VN_Receptionist_Topic1
